==Battleground==
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Imperator Sael]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**2 [[Cyberhorn]]s spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**1 [[Maawth]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Much like [[The Precipice (Insane)|The Precipice]], the enemies have low enough pushing power to where all you need are a generalist loadout and all [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]]. A battle formation for Lake of Lava should consist of 3-4 meatshields and some strong generalists such  as [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]], [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]], [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] and [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]]. If you really struggle to hold off the enemies, add some more [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]], [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating]] or [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien]] units depending on which trait is the problem; examples include [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fried Shrimp Cat]], [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] and [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]].

The start will try to fish a response out of you, but don't respond hastily! Meatshield and stall with units like [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]], fast ones preferable over small ones as meatshield gaps shouldn't be an issue. Start building up some stacks, but eventually, you'll hit the base. It plays out somewhat like the Ch. 3 Moon, but you are much more well-equipped and thus this should be much easier for you. If you keep a steady stream going, you should eventually wear down the enemies. Once J.K. Bun Bun is down, victory is generally assured, and you can come home with your sweet Catamins.

